* wizout0_http - demo: open an outbound TCP connection (channel 0) to google.com:80.
* Needs: wizi, wizcon. Puts the module in multi-connection command mode (CIPMUX=1,
* CIPMODE=0) and leaves channel 0 open; close it with AT+CIPCLOSE=0 when done.
echo * Connect to Google
echo AT+CIPMODE=0>/wz
modem /wz
echo AT+CIPMUX=1>/wz
modem /wz
echo AT+CIPSTART=0,"TCP","google.com",80,10>/wz
modem /wz
